        "purpose": "Query guidance",
        "query": "Search the relevant Falcon search experience for the alert's key entity and time window:\nalert name / detection ID: \"Risky User Detected\"\npivot on: user, host/device, SHA-256, source/destination IP, domain, process or event ID (as applicable).",
