        "tool": "SentinelOne",
        "language": "Product-specific",
        "purpose": "Query guidance",
        "query": "In Deep Visibility (if licensed/available), select the relevant event family and time range, then pivot on:\nalert: \"Unusual Outbound Traffic Volume\"\nentities: hostname, username, process/image, file hash, IP/domain, event time (as applicable).",
        "note": "SentinelOne query syntax and available fields vary by product version. This is an investigation checklist, not executable query syntax."
