        "query": "In Deep Visibility (if licensed/available), select the relevant event family and time range, then pivot on:\nalert: \"Access to Sensitive Data Outside Working Pattern\"\nentities: hostname, username, process/image, file hash, IP/domain, event time (as applicable).",
