        "query": "// Starter: search recent alert/security events for this use case.\n// Validate table and field names against your connected data sources.\nlet lookback = 24h;\nSecurityAlert\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(lookback)\n| where AlertName has_any (\"Critical Log Source Disconnected\")\n| project TimeGenerated, AlertName, AlertSeverity, ProviderName, CompromisedEntity, SystemAlertId, Description\n| order by TimeGenerated desc",
